---
import SearchForm from "./SearchForm.astro";
---

<div class="not-found-content">
  <p>網址可能有誤，或頁面已移動。你可以搜尋商品，或繼續瀏覽全部商品。</p>
  <SearchForm id="not-found-search-q" label="找不到頁面搜尋" />
  <p><a href="/products">全部商品</a></p>
</div>

<style>
  .not-found-content { max-width: 38rem; }
  .not-found-content p { line-height: 1.8; }
  .not-found-content > p:last-child { margin-top: var(--space-6); }
</style>
